      "title": "Prospectus Summary",
      "excerpt": "PROSPECTUS SUMMARY 1 THE OFFERING 6 CAUTIONARY NOTE REGARDING FORWARD-LOOKING STATEMENTS 7 RISK FACTORS 9 USE OF PROCEEDS 49 DETERMINATION OF OFFERING PRICE 49 DIVIDEND POLICY 49 MARKET INFORMATION 49 UNAUDITED PRO FORMA CONDENSED COMBINED FINANCIAL INFORMATION 50 BUSINESS 63 EXECUTIVE COMPENSATION 83 MANAGEMENT\u2019S DISCUSSION AND ANALYSIS OF FINANCIAL CONDITION AND  RESULTS\u00a0OF OPERATIONS 88 MANAGEMENT 99 CORPORATE GOVERNANCE 105 DESCRIPTION OF SECURITIES 115 MATERIAL U.S.\u00a0FEDERAL INCOME TAX CONSIDERATIONS 120 MATERIAL CANADIAN FEDERAL INCOME TAX CONSIDERATIONS 126 SECURITIES ACT RESTRICTIONS ON RESALE OF SECURITIES 129 CERTAIN RELATIONSHIPS AND RELATED PERSON TRANSACTIONS 131 BENEFICIAL OWNERSHIP OF SECURITIES 136 SELLING SECURITYHOLDERS 138 PLAN OF DISTRIBUTION 146 LEGAL MATTERS 150 EXPERTS 150 WHERE YOU CAN FIND MORE INFORMATION 151 INDEX TO FINANCIAL STATEMENTS F-1 i Table of Contents ",
